01:E6E4 CD13F3          	  1655: DIRC1	CALL	CONST	;this is an input request.
01:E6E7 B7              	  1656: 	ORA	A
01:E6E8 CA95F1          	  1657: 	JZ	GOBACK1	;not ready? Just return (directly).
